@startuml scenario-a-inspect-observation
title Scenario B — Biologist inspects an observation (UC4)

actor "Biologist" as B
participant "Dashboard" as UI
participant "API" as API
database "Storage" as Store

B -> UI : Opens a deployment
UI -> API : Request observations
API -> Store : Fetch records
Store --> API : Observation list
API --> UI : Observations with AI confidence
UI --> B : Shows table of detections

B -> UI : Clicks an interesting row
UI -> Store : Request full-resolution image
Store --> UI : Image
UI --> B : Modal with photo, taxon\nand AI confidence score

note over B
  Biologist can now inspect the observation
end note

@enduml
